    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract VRAM allocation-policy contract for the unified GPU memory hierarchy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All GPU memory managers in ThemisDB — regardless of namespace — share this interface so that tenant isolation, OOM detection, and policy gating are enforced through a single, observable surface.</para>
<para>Hierarchy overview: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_i_v_r_a_m_policy_1a9111541e3d02e25160f2faf6d5652a5f" kindref="member">IVRAMPolicy</ref><sp/><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">this</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>file)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">└──<sp/>themis::gpu::GPUMemoryManager<sp/><sp/><sp/>—<sp/>canonical,<sp/>edition-aware<sp/>singleton</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>├──<sp/>themis::llm::GPUMemoryManager<sp/><sp/><sp/>—<sp/>delegates<sp/>accounting<sp/>upward</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>└──<sp/>themis::llm::lora::GPUMemoryManager<sp/>—<sp/>delegates<sp/>accounting<sp/>upward</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Thread safety: implementations must be individually thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
